OL,3,GNEWSAPolice feared Andrew would delay
OL,4,Asearch by saying King owned his home,
OL,5,Adocuments show
OL,6,
OL,7,FThames Valley Police feared Andrew
OL,8,FMountbatten-Windsor might have tried to
OL,9,Fstop officers entering his home in
OL,10,FSandringham by saying it belonged to
OL,11,Fthe King, according to legal documents.
OL,13,FSenior officers were concerned the
OL,14,FKing's brother could argue it was not
OL,15,Fhis property, and that separate legal
OL,16,Fpermission would have to be sought
OL,17,Fbefore officers could enter it.
OL,19,FDelaying access would have risked the
OL,20,Floss of evidence, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
