OL,5,Adocuments show
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe background to Mountbatten-Windsor's
OL,8,Farrest in February has emerged in legal
OL,9,Fdocuments, when police asked a judge
OL,10,Ffor warrants to raid the former
OL,11,Fprince's homes.
